@startuml implement-plan-pipeline
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #888
skinparam ArrowColor #444
<style>
activityDiagram {
  .gate {
    BackgroundColor #FFF6DD
    LineColor #B8860B
  }
}
</style>

start
:Stabilization
stubs, migrations, contracts;
:Gate: compiles,
architecture test;<<gate>>
note right
  every gate runs the commands
  your **build.md** names
end note
:Red
unit, integration, system
tests in parallel waves;
:Gate: every planned class has
its expected RED result;<<gate>>
:Green unit + integration
in waves;
while (system step remains?) is (yes)
  :Run its focused test class;
  if (green?) then (yes)
    :Tick without an agent;
  else (no)
    :Run one system-green agent;
  endif
endwhile (no)
:Gate: full suite green;<<gate>>
:Refactor
one agent, whole diff;
:Gate: still green,
same test count;<<gate>>
:Post-implementation
performance figures,
build, coverage;
note right
  the Performance section, then
  the steps your **follow-up.md**
  gave the plan
end note
stop
@enduml
